1. Fetch the Notion task page and project context page. Retrieve only the pre-assigned task above — do NOT browse the board to pick up additional work.
2. Verify your branch: \`git branch --show-current\` → \`feature/<task-name>\`.
3. Implement the task per the acceptance criteria.
